2026-08-25T00:00:00Z (RFD66606-2013) 'Archival file naming convention
 # uuid: 6033f51e-5dbb-5b16-906c-baea4adc3195
 # tags: rfd:title
 RFD:Prediscussion  1 RFD
 Serials:VSekaiFabric

2026-08-25T00:00:01Z (RFD66606-2013) 'Committed assets carry a date-first, lowercase, sequenced name.
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2013  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-2013) 'The manuals repo now commits binary assets alongside prose, starting with screenshots under `decisions/attachments/`. Ad-hoc names like `image.png` collide, sort poorly, and lose their provenance once they leave the page that referenced them.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2013  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-2013) 'Check a new asset under `decisions/attachments/` against `YYYYMMDD_project_description_NNNN.ext` and confirm it has a matching entry under `references:` in `CITATION.cff`.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2013  1 LINE
 Text:Written

